## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

The objective of this engagement is to engineer, deploy, and scale a proprietary on-demand passenger mobility and ride-hailing platform custom-built for **PHP Movers**.

The platform is engineered specifically for the Nigerian urban transport landscape, combining the speed and operational efficiency of **Bolt** with the commercial flexibility and user empowerment of **inDrive**:

1. **The Bolt Engine (Instant Automated Dispatch):** For everyday commuters who need a quick ride immediately. Upfront automated pricing calculated dynamically by trip distance and estimated time, instantly matching riders with the closest available driver with zero negotiation.
2. **The inDrive Engine (Real-Time Fare Bidding & Negotiation):** For passengers and drivers who want full pricing transparency and choice. Passengers enter their destination and suggest a fare budget. Nearby active drivers receive the ride request and can accept the price or submit competitive counter-offers in real time.

This hybrid ecosystem connects everyday passengers with verified independent drivers while providing **PHP Movers** with automated commission deductions, real-time fleet surveillance, digital receipting, and total operational control.

