## 2. CORE PLATFORM MODULES

### Module 1: Passenger Application (Web / Mobile PWA)
* **Ride Booking & Route Selection:**
  * Clean, interactive map interface powered by Leaflet and OpenStreetMap.
  * Instant search and auto-complete for pickup and drop-off destinations with live distance and route calculation.
  * Ride Category Selection: Standard Ride (Economy Sedan), Comfort (Air Conditioned), and XL (6-Seater).
* **Dual Booking Modes (Bolt + inDrive Mechanics):**
  * *Standard Match (Bolt Model):* One-tap instant dispatch based on automated distance-and-time pricing algorithm. System automatically dispatches the closest active driver.
  * *Fare Bidding (inDrive Model):* Passenger proposes their starting fare. Nearby drivers review the route and passenger rating, then accept, counter-offer with customized bids (+₦200, +₦500, +₦1,000), or decline. The passenger reviews driver ratings, vehicle model, and ETA before selecting their preferred driver.
* **Driver Tracking & Trip Safety:**
  * Live GPS vehicle tracking showing the driver approaching the pickup location in real time.
  * Complete driver profile displayed: driver full name, verified badge, rating, vehicle make/model/color, and license plate number.
  * Live ETA countdown clock.
* **Direct Communication & Trip Security:**
  * In-app call and direct messaging button connecting passenger and driver without exposing personal phone numbers.
  * **Start-of-Trip OTP Verification:** A secure 4-digit PIN generated for the rider that the driver must confirm before the trip starts, guaranteeing rider safety.
  * Automatic digital trip receipt generated upon trip completion.

