* **Driver Onboarding & Verification:**
  * Digital registration portal for self-onboarding.
  * Document upload desk: commercial driver license, vehicle particulars, roadworthiness certificate, vehicle exterior/interior photos, and bank account details (NUBAN) for automated payouts.
* **Trip Dispatch & Bidding Terminal:**
